/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6ffbe589/D6/2/code.py:23:#      crops separately -> pack them into [outer | middle | inner].
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6ffbe589/D6/2/code.py:26:#    - The variant should be visibly different from tight-crop output on nearly every sample.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/6ffbe589/D6/2/code.py:30:#    - crop_components_near_largest(...) still assumes the board is the unique largest foreground component.
